}

.single-activity.Metacognitive.selected p.inline-inst:before {
  content: "Metacognitive tasks focus on building understanding of a learners own learning process. \aMetacognitive tasks include: \a- Self reflection and self-evaluation of learning \a- Articulation of approaches to learning \a- Setting goals and planning \a- Adapting models and theories \a- Monitoring and controlling learning \aReflective writing";
