.single-activity.Social.selected p.inline-inst:before {
  content: "Social tasks are any task that involves constructing knowledge and engaging in sense making with others. \aSocial tasks include: \a- Discussions and debates \a- Sharing or presenting of information amongst other students \a C- ollaborating with others to construct a shared understanding of a topic \a- Working with other student  to extend knowledge and understanding of a core concept";
